<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID TO PLACE PLN 678 MLN AT DRAINAGE.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID TO PLACE PLN 678 MLN AT DRAINAGE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid to place 678 million zlotys, in nominal terms, at the National Bank of Poland's reverse NBP-bill repurchase auction against a 800 million zloty offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>They also bid for 250 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills against the central bank's 150 million zloty offer.</p>
<p>Auction results should be available at about 1300 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
